  "Put the moved frames back in place": "Przywróć wybrane pozycje ramek",
  "Moves, scales and hides the parts of the interface.": "Przesuwa, skaluje i ukrywa elementy interfejsu.",
  "The key for MoveAnything! is %s.": "Skrót MoveAnything!: %s.",
  "MoveAnything! has no key. Type /move key <key> to set one. Example: /move key F7.": "Brak skrótu. Ustaw przez /move key <key>, np. /move key F7.",
  "MoveAnything! has no key now.": "Usunięto skrót MoveAnything!.",
  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now. It no longer does %s.": "%s otwiera teraz MoveAnything! zamiast akcji %s.",
  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now.": "%s otwiera teraz MoveAnything!.",
  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "Polecenia: /move (okno), /move FrameName (przesuń), /move pick (wybierz), /move hide FrameName (ukryj/pokaż), /move done (zakończ), /unmove FrameName (reset), /move key <key> (skrót), /movelist (lista), /movecopy Name (kopiuj), /movedelete Name (usuń).",
  "Type /movecopy Name. /movelist shows the names.": "Użyj /movecopy Name. Nazwy: /movelist.",
